<title>SPAIN: Banco Popular interim dividend 183.75 ptas net.</title>
<headline>Banco Popular interim dividend 183.75 ptas net.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Popular will pay an interim dividend of 183.75 pesetas net compared with 168.75 pesetas last year, it said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The payment date is from October 7.</p>
<p>Banco Popular rose 50 pesetas to 23,050 at 1045 GMT with 50,000 shares traded.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
